Title: DebugSwift Network Injection Architecture
participant "URLSession"
participant "CustomHTTPProtocol"
participant "InjectionManager"
participant "Backend Server"
participant "DebugUI"

URLSession->"CustomHTTPProtocol": startLoading()
"CustomHTTPProtocol"->"InjectionManager": Check Delay & Rules
Note over "InjectionManager": Inject 1.5s Latency\n& Mock 200 OK JSON
"CustomHTTPProtocol"-->URLSession: Return Mock Data
"CustomHTTPProtocol"->"DebugUI": Update Traffic History
